Package: anchelper
Title: ANC Helper – Control Chart Quick Reference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Deb", "Baidik", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "debbaidik@example.com")
Description: Quick-reference helpers for control charts: compute constants
    (d2, D, D1-D4, c2, A), print LCL/CL/UCL formulas for R, mean, p, np,
    c, u charts, and a guide for choosing the right chart.
